      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3017,
      "text": "and make me of those who will inherit the Garden of Bliss;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 85,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3018,
      "text": "and forgive my father, for he is one of those who have gone astray;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3019,
      "text": "and do not disgrace me on the Day when all will be resurrected –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3020,
      "text": "the Day when neither wealth nor children will be of any avail,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3021,
      "text": "except the one who comes to Allah with a sound heart[14].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 89,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3022,
      "text": "Paradise will be brought near to the righteous,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 90,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3023,
      "text": "and Hellfire will be uncovered to those who went astray,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
