      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3024,
      "text": "and they will be told, “Where are those whom you used to worship",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 92,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3025,
      "text": "other than Allah? Can they help you or even help themselves?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 93,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3026,
      "text": "Then they will be hurled into Hell one upon another, along with those who led them astray,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 94,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3027,
      "text": "and the followers of Iblīs, all together.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 95,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3028,
      "text": "There the deviants will say while quarreling with their false deities,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 96,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3029,
      "text": "“By Allah, we were clearly misguided,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 97,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3030,
      "text": "when we deemed you equal to the Lord of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 98,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3031,
      "text": "None led us astray except the wicked.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 99,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3032,
      "text": "Now we neither have any intercessors,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 100,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3033,
      "text": "nor a close friend.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 101,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3034,
      "text": "If only we had a chance to return, we would be among the believers.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 102,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3035,
      "text": "Indeed, there is a sign in this, yet most of them would not believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 103,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3036,
      "text": "Your Lord is surely the All-Mighty, the Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 104,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3037,
      "text": "The people of Noah rejected the messengers[15]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 105,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3038,
      "text": "when their brother Noah said to them, “Do you not fear Allah?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 106,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3039,
      "text": "I am a trustworthy messenger to you,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 107,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3040,
      "text": "so fear Allah, and obey me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 108,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 371,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3041,
      "text": "I seek of you no reward for this; my reward is only with the Lord of the worlds;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
